[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Small Change]
[00:00.84]Lesson 113 | 第113课
[00:03.22]Small change | 零钱
[00:05.87]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.26]Who has got some small change? | 谁有零钱？
[00:16.10]Fares, please! | 请买票！
[00:18.88]Trafalgar Square, please. | 请到特拉法尔加广场。
[00:21.25]I'm sorry, sir. | 对不起，先生。
[00:23.76]I can't change a ten-pound note. | 我没法找开这张十英镑的钞票。
[00:28.06]Haven't you got any small change? | 你没有零钱吗？
[00:31.48]I've got no small change, | 我没有零钱，
[00:34.56]I am afraid. | 恐怕是这样。
[00:36.18]I'll ask some of the passengers. | 我去问问其他乘客。
[00:39.66]Have you any small change, sir? | 先生，您有零钱吗？
[00:43.36]I'm sorry. | 对不起。
[00:44.80]I've got none. | 我没有。
[00:47.16]I haven't got any either. | 我也没有。
[00:50.96]Can you change this ten-pound note, madam? | 女士，您能找开这张十英镑的钞票吗？
[00:56.13]I'm afraid I can't. | 恐怕我不能。
[00:59.75]Neither can I. | 我也不能。
[01:02.56]I'm very sorry, sir. | 我非常抱歉，先生。
[01:05.20]You must get off the bus. | 您必须下车。
[01:08.10]None of our passengers can change this note. | 我们没有一个乘客能找开这张钞票。
[01:12.99]They're all millionaires! | 他们都是百万富翁！
[01:16.31]Except us. | 除了我们。
[01:18.60]I've got some small change. | 我有一些零钱。
[01:22.33]So have I. | 我也有。